  "claim_ceiling": "All payloads use synthetic fixture references. JSON structural validity does not verify DID ownership, signer authority, resource existence, site identity, exact owner-object bytes, qualification, capacity, calendar availability, reservation, execution, product acceptance or supplier reliability. MFG-PROC-001A source objects remain unresolved until the Symthaea current-main replay and an exact resolver are qualified."
